        "standard_solution_code": "def change(u):\n\ti = 0\n\tN = len(u)\n\tv = u[::-1]\n\tnew = ''\n\tfor i in range(N):\n\t\tnew += u[i] + v[i]\n\treturn new\nT = int(input())\nfor nnn in range(T):\n\tk = []\n\tN = int(input())\n\tfor i in range(N):\n\t\tu = input()\n\t\tu = change(u)\n\t\tk.append(u)\n\tk.sort()\n\ttt = []\n\tttt = 0\n\ti = 0\n\tnewarr = []\n\tif len(tt) < 0:\n\t\ta = 'abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz'\n\t\tb = 0\n\t\tfor i in a:\n\t\t\tm = []\n\t\t\tfor j in range(b, len(k)):\n\t\t\t\tif i == k[j][0]:\n\t\t\t\t\tm.append(k[j])\n\t\t\t\telse:\n\t\t\t\t\tb = j\n\t\t\t\t\tbreak\n\t\t\tnewarr.append(m)\n\t\tttt = 0\n\t\tfor d in newarr:\n\t\t\tif len(d) <= 1:\n\t\t\t\tcontinue\n\t\t\twhile len(d) >= 1:\n\t\t\t\ti = 0\n\t\t\t\tarr_indexes = 0\n\t\t\t\tmax1 = 0\n\t\t\t\twhile i < len(d) - 1:\n\t\t\t\t\tu = 0\n\t\t\t\t\tfor j in range(min(len(d[i]), len(d[i + 1]))):\n\t\t\t\t\t\tif d[i][j] == d[i + 1][j]:\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tu += 1\n\t\t\t\t\t\telse:\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tbreak\n\t\t\t\t\tif u > 0:\n\t\t\t\t\t\tif max1 < u:\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmax1 = u\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tarr_indexes = i\n\t\t\t\t\t\ti += 1\n\t\t\t\t\telse:\n\t\t\t\t\t\ti += 1\n\t\t\t\ttry:\n\t\t\t\t\td.pop(arr_indexes)\n\t\t\t\t\td.pop(arr_indexes)\n\t\t\t\texcept:\n\t\t\t\t\tbreak\n\t\t\t\tttt += max1 * max1\n\n\tdef my(k, mmm):\n\t\tmini = 1000000000000\n\t\tindex = 0\n\t\tfor i in range(0, len(k) - 1):\n\t\t\tu = 0\n\t\t\tfor j in range(min(len(k[i]), len(k[i + 1]))):\n\t\t\t\tif k[i][j] == k[i + 1][j]:\n\t\t\t\t\tu += 1\n\t\t\t\telse:\n\t\t\t\t\tbreak\n\t\t\tif mini > u:\n\t\t\t\tmini = u\n\t\t\t\tindex = i\n\t\tif k[0] == k[-1]:\n\t\t\tc = len(k) // 2 * len(k[0]) * len(k[0]) // 4\n\t\t\tif len(k) % 2 == 0:\n\t\t\t\treturn (0, 0, c)\n\t\t\telse:\n\t\t\t\treturn (1, mmm.index(k[0]), c)\n\t\tif len(k) == 1:\n\t\t\treturn (1, mmm.index(k[0]), 0)\n\t\tif len(k) == 2:\n\t\t\tmini = mini // 2\n\t\t\treturn (0, 0, mini * mini)\n\t\ta1 = my(k[:index + 1], mmm)\n\t\ta2 = my(k[index + 1:], mmm)\n\t\tif a1[0] == 1 and a2[0] == 1:\n\t\t\tu = 0\n\t\t\tfor j in range(min(len(mmm[a1[1]]), len(mmm[a2[1]]))):\n\t\t\t\tif mmm[a1[1]][j] == mmm[a2[1]][j]:\n\t\t\t\t\tu += 1\n\t\t\t\telse:\n\t\t\t\t\tbreak\n\t\t\tu = u // 2\n\t\t\treturn (0, 0, a1[2] + a2[2] + u * u)\n\t\telif a1[0] == 1 and a2[0] == 0:\n\t\t\treturn (1, a1[1], a1[2] + a2[2])\n\t\telif a1[0] == 0 and a2[0] == 1:\n\t\t\treturn (1, a2[1], a1[2] + a2[2])\n\t\telse:\n\t\t\treturn (0, 0, a1[2] + a2[2])\n\tmmm = k[:]\n\ta = my(k, mmm)\n\tprint(a[2])"
