          "description": "一个 stanza 由两个字符串组成；一个 verse 是零个或多个 stanza 的序列。",
          "formal": "A verse is a sequence of pairs {(a_1, b_1), ..., (a_m, b_m)} where each a_i, b_i are chosen from the edited strings.",
          "source_sections": [
            "description"
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "allow_unused_elements",
          "description": "不必使用所有原始字符串（或其编辑后版本），可选择任意子集构成 verse。",
          "formal": "The number of strings used in the verse is ≤ N.",
