            "constraints"
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "edit_operation_definition",
          "description": "一次编辑定义为选择一个字符串的某个位置 p，将其字符替换为任意小写字母，并支付该位置对应的代价 c_{i,p}。可对同一字符串的不同位置进行多次编辑，总编辑次数无上限，总代价为各编辑代价之和。",
          "formal": "An edit on string i at position p changes the character to any lowercase letter and incurs cost c_{i,p}. The total edit cost is the sum of costs of all performed edits.",
          "source_sections": [
            "description"
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "target_beauty_threshold",
          "description": "必须存在一个编辑方案和一个合法配对方案，使得总 beauty 至少为 K。若不存在，输出 -1。",
          "formal": "∃ edit plan and selection of stanzas such that ∑ min(l_p, l_s)^2 ≥ K. If impossible, output -1.",
          "source_sections": [
            "description"
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "beauty_definition",
          "description": "两个字符串的 beauty 定义为 min(最长公共前缀长度, 最长公共后缀长度) 的平方。",
